OL,3,GNEWSACharity partnership helping
OL,4,Afootball fans open up
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinking up with a suicide prevention
OL,7,Fcharity has helped Worthing Football
OL,8,FClub fans open up about their mental
OL,9,Fhealth, its supporters' association has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThis season the club has partnered with
OL,13,FOlly's Future, founded by Ann Feloy in
OL,14,F2020 after son Olly Hare, who grew up
OL,15,Fin Worthing, died by suicide at the age
OL,16,Fof 22.
OL,18,FFoley believes that "everyone involved
OL,19,Fin football can get behind this message
OL,20,Fof looking out for someone they might
OL,21,Fbe worried about".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
