OL,3,GNEWSACharity partnership helping
OL,4,Afootball fans open up
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatalie Lunn, secretary for the
OL,7,Fsupporters' association, said "people
OL,8,Fhave come up and said things to us that
OL,9,Fwouldn't have happened if we hadn't
OL,10,Fbeen supporting this charity".
